" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Write philosophical dialogues as a boy</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"638\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">Practice reasoning early — it shapes you</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"680\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"725\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">4.</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"725\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Sleep on a plank with a skin</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"758\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">Greek philosophical austerity — at age 12</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"810\" width=\"800\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"865\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">THE MOST TELLING DETAIL</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"910\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">His mother had to persuade him to use a couch</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"945\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">The richest child in Rome chose the hard board</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"975\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Character training begins early — and physically</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"1010\" width=\"700\" height=\"50\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"1045\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"20\">Discomfort as deliberate practice</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Choosing the hard board"
