" font-size=\"18\">Tranquility</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"470\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Pleasure still the goal</text><rect x=\"720\" y=\"180\" width=\"300\" height=\"330\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"870\" y=\"235\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">STOIC</text><text x=\"870\" y=\"280\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">\"Be good NOW\"</text><text x=\"870\" y=\"325\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">No time left for</text><text x=\"870\" y=\"355\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">vice or pettiness</text><text x=\"870\" y=\"385\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Moral urgency,</text><text x=\"870\" y=\"415\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">not consumption</text><text x=\"870\" y=\"470\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Deadline for becoming</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"550\" width=\"800\" height=\"210\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"605\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">THE STRUCTURAL DIFFERENCE</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"650\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Experiences can be stolen by circumstance</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"690\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Character can't be</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"730\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">One project is theft-proof until the last breath — bet on it</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"800\" width=\"800\" height=\"190\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"855\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">MEDITATIONS 4.17</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"900\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-style=\"italic\" font-size=\"22\">\"Do not act as if you would live ten thousand years...</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"940\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-style=\"italic\" font-size=\"22\">While you live, while it is in your power, be good.\"</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"1020\" width=\"700\" height=\"50\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"1053\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-size=\"20\">Death: deadline for becoming, not collecting</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Three philosophies, one clock"
