" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"775\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">THE LAST WORDS</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"820\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-style=\"italic\" font-size=\"24\">\"Go to the rising sun;</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"858\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-style=\"italic\" font-size=\"24\">I am already setting.\"</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"920\" width=\"800\" height=\"140\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"970\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">THE EVIDENCE</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"1010\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Decades of rehearsal — and the practice held under final load</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"1042\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">He wrote the manual, then had to use it. It worked.</text></svg>",
