      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Every word is load-bearing</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"180\" width=\"800\" height=\"140\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"228\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">BRIEF + SCHEDULED</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"265\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">You choose when it starts and stops</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"298\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">This is the firewall against rumination</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"345\" width=\"800\" height=\"140\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"393\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">SPECIFIC</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"430\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">\"The client cancels\" — not \"something bad\"</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"463\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Named scenarios feed planning circuitry</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"510\" width=\"800\" height=\"140\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"558\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">RESPONDING WELL (most forgotten)</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"595\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Visualize yourself sailing the storm, not just the storm</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"628\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Cache the script before you need it</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"675\" width=\"800\" height=\"140\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"723\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">NOT A PREDICTION</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"760\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">No claim that bad things WILL happen</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"793\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">That's pessimism — a different (worse) practice</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"850\" width=\"800\" height=\"210\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"910\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">THE STOIC POSTURE</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"960\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Expect the best. Prepare for the worst.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"1000\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Be surprised by neither.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"1038\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Foresight softens arrival — Cicero</text></svg>",
