      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">What the reserve clause buys</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"180\" width=\"800\" height=\"160\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"230\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">AN ACCURACY DEVICE</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"272\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Writes into the plan what was true anyway:</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"310\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">outcomes depend on more than your will</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"370\" width=\"800\" height=\"150\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"418\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">PAYOFF 1: ANTI-BRITTLENESS</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"455\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Commit to attempts, not outcomes —</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"490\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">success banked when the attempt is honestly made</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"550\" width=\"800\" height=\"150\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"598\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">PAYOFF 2: RECOVERY SPEED</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"635\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">\"Nothing happens against his expectation\"</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"670\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Failure rehearsed → response script cached</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"730\" width=\"800\" height=\"150\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"778\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">PAYOFF 3: PRE-LOADED PLAN B (6.50)</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"815\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Obstacle → material for a different virtue</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"850\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Patience instead of efficiency; justice instead of speed</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"910\" width=\"800\" height=\"150\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"962\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">NOT A HEDGE, NOT A SUPERSTITION</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"1005\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Layer 1 keeps total commitment; Layer 2 keeps you whole</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"1040\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Amor fati in embryo — next lesson</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Plans break; planners don't have to"
