      "svg": "<svg viewBox='0 0 1100 1100'><rect x='0' y='0' width='1100' height='1100' fill='#1a1a2e'/><text x='550' y='75' font-size='30' fill='#ffd700' text-anchor='middle'>Three Ways He Restates It</text><rect x='90' y='140' width='920' height='160' rx='14' fill='#0ea5e9'/><text x='550' y='195' font-size='21' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>The Breathing Cosmos</text><text x='550' y='230' font-size='19' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>one exhale within a larger,</text><text x='550' y='262' font-size='19' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>ongoing respiration of matter</text><rect x='90' y='340' width='920' height='160' rx='14' fill='#ec4899'/><text x='550' y='395' font-size='21' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>Stages Already Survived</text><text x='550' y='430' font-size='19' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>infancy to youth to age,</text><text x='550' y='462' font-size='19' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>each a death already lived through</text><rect x='90' y='540' width='920' height='160' rx='14' fill='#6366f1'/><text x='550' y='595' font-size='21' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>The Bare Formula</text><text x='550' y='630' font-size='19' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>scatter into atoms, or</text><text x='550' y='662' font-size='19' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>gather into ordered whole</text><rect x='200' y='760' width='700' height='140' rx='14' fill='#1a1a2e' stroke='#ffd700' stroke-width='4'/><text x='550' y='815' font-size='20' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>Constant across all three:</text><text x='550' y='850' font-size='20' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>no dependence on an afterlife claim</text><text x='550' y='980' font-size='19' fill='#888' text-anchor='middle'>Repetition suggests private rehearsal, not settled doctrine</text></svg>",
